<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<class name="BoneClothPreset" inherits="Resource" api_type="extension" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot/master/doc/class.xsd">
	<brief_description>
		The values of a [BoneClothSimulator3D] saved as a resource.
	</brief_description>
	<description>
		A preset holds the values of a [BoneClothSimulator3D]. Apply one with [method BoneClothSimulator3D.apply_preset] and create one with [method BoneClothSimulator3D.make_preset]. The chains, [member BoneClothSimulator3D.link_mode] and the collisions are not included.
		In the 3D editor, the node's toolbar menu lists the project's presets under [b]Presets[/b], and [b]Save Preset...[/b] saves a new one. The plugin includes six presets in [code]addons/bone_cloth/presets/[/code].
	</description>
